{
  "quest.5B77D5B6B114F8E7.quest_desc": [
    "When The Harmonic dies, a &bCrystal Forest&r starts growing from the spot. It spreads until it covers a 96 block radius, which takes about 16 minutes.",
    "",
    "The forest turns end stone and basalt into crystal grass, grows crystal trees and brings in Crystal Rabbits and Crystal Armadillos. It only grows in loaded chunks, so stay close while it spreads.",
  ],
  "quest.4A4DCCA388BB4131.title": "&dResonance",
  "quest.5B4CF39A8E66EFE8.title": "&dCrystal Fragment",
  "quest.5F1395A57ED60EA9.title": "&aResonance Relay",
  "quest.26D8F33ED69CA752.quest_desc": [
    "The &aResonant Spear&r uses up the mark. Hitting a target that has &bResonance&r removes the effect and deals 7 bonus damage.",
    "",
    "Open with the sword to apply the mark, then switch to the spear for the extra hit.",
  ],
  "quest.5B77D5B6B114F8E7.title": "&dCrystal Forest",
  "quest.13553FB69A409A3C.quest_desc": [
    "The &aResonant Sword&r marks everything it hits with &bResonance&r, so each hit after the first deals more damage.",
    "",
    "Killing marked mobs has side effects. Their deaths can bring out new crystal creatures and turn nearby stone into amethyst, and the rest of this chapter builds on that.",
    "",
    "Right-click a sculk sensor with the sword, axe or spear to mark every monster within 8 blocks with Resonance II for 10 seconds.",
  ],
  "quest.173844FF90D32141.title": "&dResonant Wolf Armor",
  "quest.23AA90CD5AE29FE0.title": "&aResonant Horse Armor",
  "quest.40A3ED3E8C7150D1.quest_desc": [
    "&cShattered Echoes&r spawn in amethyst geodes, only in the dark and only next to amethyst with calcite or smooth basalt around it.",
    "",
    "Exploring a geode can also set off an ambush. They only have 24 health, so bring light and a weapon and you'll be fine.",
  ],
  "quest.173844FF90D32141.quest_desc": [
    "&aCrystal Armadillos&r shed a &2Crystal Scute&r every 5 to 10 minutes, and brushing one gets you a scute on the spot.",
    "",
    "&dResonant Wolf Armor&r takes the damage your wolf would take, using up its own durability instead.",
  ],
  "quest.14D959D707960395.title": "&aResonant Arrows",
  "quest.688AEF1836224F70.quest_desc": [
    "Every Resonant tool mines like diamond, has 780 durability and repairs with Amethyst Ingots. Each one has a trick of its own.",
    "",
    "- &aPickaxe&r: 15% chance to also break up to 3 matching blocks next to the one you mine.",
    "- &2Axe&r: 40% chance, on a target that's already marked, to spread &bResonance&r to mobs within 3 blocks.",
    "- &aShovel&r: paths it makes give up to 20% extra speed.",
    "- &2Hoe&r: farmland it tills gets an extra 20% roll to grow the crop.",
  ],
  "quest.4C19A536A5728595.title": "&5The Harmonic Arena",
  "quest.14D959D707960395.quest_desc": [
    "Resonant Arrows put &bResonance&r on whatever they hit, so you can mark a target before it gets close.",
  ],
  "quest.12B104EC9EBC037F.title": "&dWhisper Fragment",
  "quest.1FE29273851FCD53.title": "&5Three Fragments",
  "quest.409198E1B4B019C6.quest_desc": [
    "A &3Resonant Lantern&r marks every monster within 12 blocks with &bResonance&r every 3 seconds. Hang one over a mob farm and the whole kill zone takes extra damage.",
    "",
    "Marked mobs can leave scars when they die, and seven scars close together bring out a &cCrystal Wraith&r. A lantern over a busy farm will keep them coming.",
    "",
    "About one marked death in ten also turns nearby stone into amethyst blocks, sometimes with a &dBudding Amethyst&r among them.",
  ],
  "quest.13553FB69A409A3C.title": "&dResonant Sword",
  "quest.4C19A536A5728595.quest_desc": [
    "The &dChorus Resonator&r has no recipe. It sits in the middle of a &bHarmonic Arena&r, which only generates in the &bCrystallized End&r biome in the End.",
    "",
    "The resonator needs 8 pillars of amethyst blocks, each at least 8 tall and between 10 and 22 blocks away. The arena comes with them already built, so leave them standing.",
    "",
    "&cCrystal Sentinels&r guard the biome. Put all three fragments into the resonator to start the summon.",
  ],
  "quest.500EB382B0DC9055.quest_desc": [
    "The &dResonant Totem&r saves you from death the same way a Totem of Undying does. When it triggers, every creature within 8 blocks gets &bResonance III&r for 10 seconds.",
    "",
    "That's 60% extra damage on everything that nearly killed you.",
  ],
  "quest.12B104EC9EBC037F.quest_desc": [
    "A &cResonant Stalker&r has a 1% chance to appear when you kill a mob that has &bResonance&r. It shows up where the mob died, and nothing else spawns it.",
    "",
    "The kill has to be yours. Deaths from traps and machines don't count, so fight at a mob grinder with the Resonant Sword to get enough chances.",
  ],
  "quest.1FE29273851FCD53.quest_desc": [
    "The end of &eResonance&r is a boss called &cThe Harmonic&r. Summoning it takes one each of three fragments, and each fragment comes from a different crystal creature.",
    "",
    "Every one of those creatures drops its fragment 20% of the time, and Looting raises the chance.",
  ],
  "quest.409198E1B4B019C6.title": "&3Resonant Lantern",
  "quest.500EB382B0DC9055.title": "&dResonant Totem",
  "quest.69555EBF3EE460F6.quest_desc": [
    "&cThe Harmonic&r has 500 health and fights in three phases.",
    "",
    "- &bFirst&r: a shield absorbs the first hit and comes back after 6 seconds.",
    "- &3At 70% health&r: it can't be hurt until its guards are dead. That means six Crystal Sentinels, three Shattered Echoes and one Crystal Wraith.",
    "- &bAt 40% health&r: it can't be hurt until you break the 8 anchors on top of the pillars. One hit breaks each anchor.",
    "",
    "It ignores damage that has no attacker, so lava and falls won't help.",
    "",
    "&cIf nobody is within 48 blocks for 10 seconds, it leaves and the fragments are gone.",
  ],
  "quest.40A3ED3E8C7150D1.title": "&dHarmonic Fragment",
  "quest.5B4CF39A8E66EFE8.quest_desc": [
    "When a marked mob dies, it has a 50% chance to leave a scar that lasts one minute. Once seven scars sit within 8 blocks of each other, a &cCrystal Wraith&r climbs out of the ground.",
    "",
    "Any marked death counts here, even ones from a farm. The Wraith has 50 health behind 20 points of crystal armor, and its health doesn't go down until the armor breaks.",
  ],
  "quest.5F1395A57ED60EA9.quest_desc": [
    "With an empty hand, right-click one &aResonance Relay&r and then another to link them. While anything with &bResonance&r is within 8 blocks of one relay, the other puts out a full redstone signal.",
    "",
    "Use it to switch parts of a farm on and off, or as an alarm.",
  ],
  "quest.688AEF1836224F70.title": "&aTuned Toolkit",
  "quest.69555EBF3EE460F6.title": "&6The Harmonic",
  "quest.23AA90CD5AE29FE0.quest_desc": [
    "Neither &aResonant Horse Armor&r nor &2Resonant Nautilus Armor&r has a recipe. The horse armor turns up in Ancient City and End City chests, and the nautilus armor in buried treasure and shipwreck treasure.",
    "",
    "Both show up in roughly 1 chest out of 100, so treat this one as a bonus.",
  ],
  "quest.26D8F33ED69CA752.title": "&aResonant Spear",
  "quest.1B65544DB3E28173.quest_desc": [
    "Resonant armor gives 3, 7, 6 and 3 armor points from helmet to boots, with 1 toughness each. Every piece also does something extra.",
    "",
    "- &aHelmet&r: marked mobs within 16 blocks glow for you.",
    "- &2Chestplate&r: anything that hits you gets marked.",
    "- &aLeggings&r: 10% more speed on stone, deepslate and amethyst.",
    "- &2Boots&r: every fall counts as 2 blocks shorter.",
    "",
    "Wear all four for the &bHarmonic Shield&r. It cancels one hit every 30 seconds (fall damage excluded), and sculk sensors and the Warden can't hear you.",
  ],
  "quest.1B65544DB3E28173.title": "&aCover Your Frequencies",
  "quest.4A4DCCA388BB4131.quest_desc": [
    "&eResonance&r builds a full set of gear out of amethyst, and all of it starts with the &aAmethyst Ingot&r.",
    "",
    "Resonant gear puts the &bResonance&r effect on your targets. A marked target takes 20% more damage per level of the effect for 5 seconds.",
    "",
    "Geodes give you the shards. Ancient City and End City chests sometimes hold ingots ready to use.",
  ],
}